    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_first_01",
      "hash64": "2D97FCDC3B58BD6E",
      "text": "想被莉普我\\n施魔法的人是哪位呢？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "52A8E16EF1BB79F7",
      "text": "呵呵！[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n好久不见哦～[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "52A8E06EF1BB7844",
      "text": "莉普我啊，\\n听说[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你在叫我。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "52A8E36EF1BB7D5D",
      "text": "就乘上“飞翔车出租”\\n赶紧过来了。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "52A8E26EF1BB7BAA",
      "text": "莉普我的课程……对学生们来说\\n有点刺激，真的没问题吗？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "52A8DD6EF1BB732B",
      "text": "如果发生了什么，\\n你会负责任的，没错吧？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "52A8DC6EF1BB7178",
      "text": "呵呵，莉普我的骑士，\\n真是可靠啊。\\r\\n但这只是个玩笑，你放心吧。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "305FAA84C1812F2E",
      "text": "呵呵……\\n你担心的样子真可爱。\\r\\n这只是个玩笑，你放心吧。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "FC4317675651B988",
      "text": "非常“幸荣”\\n你再次邀请我来。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "FC4318675651BB3B",
      "text": "说起来，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你记得莉普我是干什么工作的吗？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "25883AAEC9E113C2",
      "text": "空中乘务员",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "258839AEC9E1120F",
      "text": "崇尚自然艺术家",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "258838AEC9E1105C",
      "text": "化妆师",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "FC4319675651BCEE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，可不许你这样回答哦。\\n虽然空姐的确也很适合我……\\c\\n但莉普我是个化妆师！\\n你要好～好记住哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "F7C0B697ACE361E4",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，可不许你这样回答哦。\\n干这个的是个奇怪的艺术家！\\c\\n莉普我是个化妆师！\\n你要好～好记住哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_02c",
      "hash64": "F7C0B797ACE36397",
      "text": "答得对！\\n莉普我是个化妆师！\\c\\n而且还兼职模特\\n和道馆馆主。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "FC431A675651BEA1",
      "text": "在这里有很多不认识的人，\\n当告诉他们莉普我的职业后，\\r\\n大家都非～常感兴趣。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "FC431B675651C054",
      "text": "尽管莉普我在帕底亚是人尽皆知的名人，\\n但在海外也只是“通普人”啊。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "FC431C675651C207",
      "text": "一不做二不休，我要让全世界\\n都知道莉普的美丽秘诀！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "CE890D60F3760F59",
      "text": "说起来，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你还记得你和莉普我之间的约定吗？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "CE890C60F3760DA6",
      "text": "能好好记住来自长辈的意见，\\n真是了不起呀。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "68EDCCBDB199640C",
      "text": "虽然你装傻的样子也很可爱……\\n但仅限现在哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "CE890B60F3760BF3",
      "text": "要让自己的才能登峰造极，\\n不断发光发亮的约定……[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "CE890A60F3760A40",
      "text": "看来我完全不用担心！\\n不如说……呵呵！\\r\\n莉普我甚至有点“惊吃”。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "CE891160F3761625",
      "text": "怎样？等你再长大一点后，\\n要来莉普我的公司工作吗？\\r\\n我相信你能在世界上打响名堂。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "3AC4424555EA2645",
      "text": "拜托你了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "3AC43F4555EA212C",
      "text": "该怎么办呢……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "CE891060F3761472",
      "text": "呵呵！我就先\\n不听你的答复了。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "5FDF20F4F514844B",
      "text": "可不许你忘了\\n和莉普我的新约定哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "5FDF1FF4F5148298",
      "text": "为了能让你记住这个新约定……\\n你要和莉普我创造一些回忆吗？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "5FDF22F4F51487B1",
      "text": "……对了！来和莉普我\\n进行宝可梦交换吧！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "5FDF21F4F51485FE",
      "text": "呵呵！这样才对嘛！\\n莉普我会用飘飘雏来交换，\\r\\n你会选择哪个孩子呢？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
