    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "083359ED58960655",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "32B16CE20F2D76ED",
      "text": "……可不许在同行宝可梦\\n只有１只时进行交换哦。\\c\\n要是同行宝可梦至少有２只的话，\\n那还好说……[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
