    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "DB703C5C5A1513F3",
      "text": "在美丽上我们可是打成平手的哦。\\n来，收下我的心意吧。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "DB703B5C5A151240",
      "text": "呵呵，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你要再来当我的对手哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "9DBA5066B6FFF7C9",
      "text": "无论是对战上，还是美丽上，\\n莉普我都赢了。\\c\\n不过，“托拜”你不要灰心，\\n也不要太介意哦。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "EDF60E1629A1C954",
      "text": "虽然莉普我很忙，\\n但只要是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你叫我，\\r\\n我随时都会赶紧过来的！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "EDF60F1629A1CB07",
      "text": "凰檗当老师\\n当得还好～吗？\\r\\n那孩子从以前开始就有点冒失。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "EDF6101629A1CCBA",
      "text": "平时总摆同一个姿势\\n是不可取的哦。\\c\\n这时该怎么办才好？\\n呵呵！当然是做喜怒惊乐体操啊！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "EDF6111629A1CE6D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]真是很棒的素材，\\n我会把它培育得美丽动人的。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "EDF60A1629A1C288",
      "text": "莉普我的飘飘雏\\n过得还好吗？\\c\\n它既“大强”，又“害厉”，\\n是个会让人“惊吃”的好素材吧！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_randomtalk_sp",
      "hash64": "ED26C01628F1A88F",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，你……\\n把莉普我选为了\\r\\n你最喜欢的道馆馆主啊。\\c\\n是那个人……\\n也慈她告诉我的。\\c\\n明明只要你跟我说一声，\\n我马上就会来把你私藏起来的……\\c\\n莉普我对你也很中意哦！\\n呵呵……！两情相悦呢！[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
